// PORT: SOURCE PINBALL_GAME_BUTTONS_AND_LIGHTS.agc:2750
//
// PORT: SOURCE PINBALL_GAME_BUTTONS_AND_LIGHTS.agc:2751
//# ALMCYCLE TURNS ON CHECK FAIL LIGHT, REDISPLAYS THE ORIGINAL VERB THAT
// PORT: SOURCE PINBALL_GAME_BUTTONS_AND_LIGHTS.agc:2752
//# WAS EXECUTED, AND RECYCLES TO EXECUTE THE ORIGINAL VERB/NOUN COMBINATION
// PORT: SOURCE PINBALL_GAME_BUTTONS_AND_LIGHTS.agc:2753
